    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The target hit by the attack roll takes an extra 5d10 Force damage from the attack. If the attack reduces it to 50 Hit Points or fewer, it must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or be sent to a harmless demiplane for the duration, where it has the &amp;Reference[incapacitated apply=false]{Incapacitated} condition. When the spell ends, it reappears in the space it left, or in the nearest unoccupied space if that one is occupied.</p>",
